# ─── Secrets & environment ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NOTE: `.env.*` also matches nested templates, so EVERY `.env.example` is
# explicitly re-included below — otherwise a new app's template would be
# silently untrackable.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!**/.env.example
# Test env is committed on purpose: synthetic dummies only, so the suite is
# hermetic and never reads a developer's real .env.
!**/.env.test
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.cert
*.crt
secrets/

